{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <p><strong>1. M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong>: ph\u1ea7n video b\u00e0i \u0111\u1ecdc n\u00e0y h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean \u0111\u1ecdc \u0111\u00fang ng\u1eef \u0111i\u1ec7u v\u00e0 l\u00fd gi\u1ea3i n\u1ed9i dung b\u00e0i kh\u00f3a.<br><strong>2. H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn<\/strong>: h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean xem video 3 l\u1ea7n:<br>- L\u1ea7n 1 (nghe v\u00e0 \u0111o\u00e1n ngh\u0129a): xem video v\u00e0 \u0111o\u00e1n ngh\u0129a d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean t\u00ecnh hu\u1ed1ng trong video.<br>* L\u01b0u \u00fd: h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o danh s\u00e1ch t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng v\u00e0 ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p \u1edf d\u01b0\u1edbi video \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111o\u00e1n ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a b\u00e0i kh\u00f3a.<br>- L\u1ea7n 2 (b\u1eaft ch\u01b0\u1edbc): xem video, d\u1eebng t\u1eebng c\u00e2u v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecdc theo. L\u01b0u \u00fd: ng\u1eaft ngh\u1ec9, l\u1ea5y h\u01a1i t\u1ea1i d\u1ea5u \u300c\u3001\u300d\u300c\u3002\u300d.<br>- L\u1ea7n 3 (shadowing): xem video, \u0111\u1ecdc theo (kh\u00f4ng d\u1eebng t\u1eebng c\u00e2u).&nbsp;<br><strong>3. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh<\/strong>:&nbsp;<br>- H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean xem h\u1ebft video, t\u00edch v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c \"done\" (ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh).<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Unit 13\u30fb\u8a9e\u5f59\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\uff0817\u500b\uff09<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:77.99%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:30.9%;\"><col style=\"width:35.24%;\"><col style=\"width:33.86%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u3053\u3068\u3070<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u6f22\u5b57<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u30d9\u30c8\u30ca\u30e0\u8a9e<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u306f<\/td><td>\u6b6f<\/td><td>r\u0103ng<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u307f\u304c\u304d\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u78e8\u304d\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u0111\u00e1nh (r\u0103ng), ch\u00e0<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u30b7\u30e3\u30ef\u30fc\u3092\u3042\u3073\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u30b7\u30e3\u30ef\u30fc\u3092\u6d74\u3073\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>t\u1eafm (v\u00f2i hoa sen)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3082\u3046\u3044\u3061\u3069<\/td><td>\u3082\u3046\u4e00\u5ea6<\/td><td>m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n n\u1eefa<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\uff5e\u3058\u304b\u3093\u3081<\/td><td>\uff5e\u6642\u9593\u76ee<\/td><td>ti\u1ebft th\u1ee9 ~<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3042\u304b\u308b\u3044<\/td><td>\u660e\u308b\u3044<\/td><td>s\u00e1ng<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3082\u3046<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u0111\u00e3\u2026r\u1ed3i<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u304f\u3089\u3044<\/td><td>\u6697\u3044<\/td><td>t\u1ed1i<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3053\u308f\u3044<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>s\u1ee3<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3046\u304c\u3044\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>s\u00fac mi\u1ec7ng<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3058\u3063\u3051\u3093\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u5b9f\u9a13\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>l\u00e0m th\u00ed nghi\u1ec7m<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u306f\u3063\u3074\u3087\u3046<\/td><td>\u767a\u8868<\/td><td>ph\u00e1t bi\u1ec3u<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3058\u3085\u3093\u3073\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u6e96\u5099\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3066\u3064\u3084\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u5fb9\u591c\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>th\u1ee9c \u0111\u00eam<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u3064\u304d\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u7740\u304d\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u0111\u1ebfn<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>\u305d\u3093\u306a\u3068\u304d<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>nh\u1eefng l\u00fac nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Unit 13\u30fb\u6587\u578b\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>A.<u>M\u1eabu ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p ch\u00ednh<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;1.\uff5e\u305f\u3089\u2780\uff08\uff5e\u3042\u3068\uff5e\uff09<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:57.72%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u3046\u3061\u306b\u5e30\u3063<strong><u>\u305f\u3089<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u3059\u3050\u306b\u624b\u3092\u6d17\u3063\u3066\u3046\u304c\u3044\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(Sau khi v\u1ec1 nh\u00e0 th\u00ec ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c r\u1eeda tay r\u1ed3i s\u00fac mi\u1ec7ng.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u3054\u98ef\u304c\u7d42\u308f\u3063<strong><u>\u305f\u3089<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(Sau khi \u0103n xong th\u00ec check mail.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; a. <u>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u>:<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Di\u1ec5n t\u1ea3 \u00fd sau khi V1 x\u1ea3y ra trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai th\u00ec s\u1ebd l\u00e0m V2.<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; b. <u>C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u>:<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:25.66%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>&nbsp;V\u305f\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3089\u3001\u301c<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;2.\uff5e\u305f\u3089\u2461\uff08\uff5e\u6761\u4ef6\u6587\uff5e\uff09<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:43.34%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u7537\u306e\u4eba\u3060\u3063<strong><u>\u305f\u3089<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u4e00\u4eba\u3067\u65c5\u884c\u306b\u884c\u304d\u307e\u3059 \u3002&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;(N\u1ebfu l\u00e0 con trai t\u00f4i s\u1ebd \u0111i du l\u1ecbch m\u1ed9t m\u00ecnh.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u6687\uff08\u3072\u307e\uff09\u3060\u3063<strong><u>\u305f\u3089<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u904a\u3073\u306b\u884c\u304d\u305f\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp;(N\u1ebfu r\u1ea3nh, t\u00f4i mu\u1ed1n \u0111i ch\u01a1i.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; a. <u>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u>:&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh&nbsp;n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, th\u00ec vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec s\u1ebd x\u1ea3y ra: \u201cN\u1ebfu A th\u00ec B\u201d.<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; b. <u>C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u>:<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:35.8%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>V\u305f&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \uff0b\u3000\u3089\u3001\u301c<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>N\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3060\u3063\u305f<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Adj\u306a\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3060\u3063\u305f<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Adj<\/strong><s><strong>\u3044<\/strong><\/s><strong>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u304b\u3063\u305f<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\uff08\u904e\u53bb\u5f62\uff09<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><br>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>&nbsp; 3. V1\u3066V2<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:50.65%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u3046\u3061\u306b\u5e30\u3063\u305f\u3089\u3001\u3059\u3050\u306b\u624b\u3092\u6d17\u3063<strong><u>\u3066<\/u><\/strong>\u3046\u304c\u3044\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(Sau khi v\u1ec1 nh\u00e0 th\u00ec ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c r\u1eeda tay r\u1ed3i s\u00fac mi\u1ec7ng.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u6669\u3054\u98ef\u3092\u4f5c\u3063<strong><u>\u3066<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u98df\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp;(N\u1ea5u b\u1eefa t\u1ed1i r\u1ed3i \u0103n.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; a. <u>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u>:<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 li\u1ec7t k\u00ea c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb c\u00f3 th\u1ee9 t\u1ef1 th\u1eddi gian. L\u00e0m V1 r\u1ed3i l\u00e0m V2 r\u1ed3i l\u00e0m V3.<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; b. <u>C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u>:<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:25.19%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>V1\u3066\u3001V2\u3066\u3001V3\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>&nbsp; 4. V1\u3066\u304b\u3089V2<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:51.59%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u6bce\u65e5\u5bbf\u984c\uff08\u3057\u3085\u304f\u3060\u3044\uff09\u3092\u3057<strong><u>\u3066\u304b\u3089<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u30c6\u30ec\u30d3\u3092\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(M\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y sau khi l\u00e0m xong b\u00e0i t\u1eadp s\u1ebd xem tivi)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u304a\u304f\u3063<strong><u>\u3066\u304b\u3089<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u304b\u3048\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(Sau khi g\u1eedi mail xong s\u1ebd \u0111i v\u1ec1)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; a. <u>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u>:&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Di\u1ec5n t\u1ea3 1 h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng, s\u1ef1 vi\u1ec7c di\u1ec5n ra tr\u01b0\u1edbc 1 h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng hay s\u1ef1 vi\u1ec7c kh\u00e1c. Sau khi l\u00e0m V1 r\u1ed3i m\u1edbi l\u00e0m V2.<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; b. <u>C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u>:<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:32.03%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>&nbsp;V1\u3066\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u304b\u3089\u3001V2\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>&nbsp; 5. V1\u306a\u304c\u3089V2<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:57.48%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u30ea\u3055\u3093\u306f\u65b0\u805e\uff08\u3057\u3093\u3076\u3093\uff09\u3092\u8aad\u307f<strong><u>\u306a\u304c\u3089<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u671d\u3054\u306f\u3093\u3092\u98df\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(Li v\u1eeba \u0103n s\u00e1ng v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ecdc b\u00e1o.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u3042\u304d\u304a\u3055\u3093\u306f\u30c6\u30ec\u30d3\u3067\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30b9\u3092\u898b<strong><u>\u306a\u304c\u3089<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u671d\u3054\u306f\u3093\u3092\u98df\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(Akio v\u1eeba \u0103n s\u00e1ng v\u1eeba xem tin t\u1ee9c tr\u00ean tivi.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; a. <u>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u>:&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Di\u1ec5n t\u1ea3 hai h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, v\u1eeba l\u00e0m V1 v\u1eeba l\u00e0m V2.<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; b. <u>C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u>:\u3000<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:31.32%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>V1\u307e\u3059\u5f62\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3001V2<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>B. <u>M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e1ch di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t hay d\u00f9ng:<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>&nbsp; 6. N\u3060\u3051<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:51.35%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li>\u30ea\u3055\u3093\u306f\u6bce\u65e5\u8089<strong><u>\u3060\u3051<\/u><\/strong>\u98df\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002(H\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y Li ch\u1ec9 \u0103n th\u1ecbt.)&nbsp;<\/li><li>30\u5206<strong><u>\u3060\u3051<\/u><\/strong>\u4f11\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (Ch\u1ec9 ngh\u1ec9 c\u00f3 30 ph\u00fat.)<\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; a. <u>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u>:&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 N th\u00f4i (Ngo\u00e0i N ra kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 c\u00e1i n\u00e0o kh\u00e1c, N \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 \u00edt)<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; b. <u>C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u>:\u3000<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:11.29%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>N\u3060\u3051<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n    <\/div>\n"}